&lt;p&gt;Duties: Architect software systems supporting the CoreWeave Cloud Platform. Lead &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; product engineering initiatives. Write software tests. Perform code quality reviews. Mentor junior engineers. Write technical documentation. Create architectural diagrams. Translate product requirements &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;into&lt;/span&gt; units of engineering work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Telecommuting permitted&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;20&lt;/span&gt;% of the time: work may be performed within normal commuting distance &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; the CoreWeave office &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; New York, NY.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Export Control Compliance This position requires access to export controlled information. To conform to U.S. Government export regulations applicable to that information, &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-function&quot;&gt;applicant must either &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;be&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;) a U.S. person, defined &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;) U.S. citizen &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; national, (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;ii&lt;/span&gt;) U.S. lawful permanent &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;resident&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;green card holder&lt;/span&gt;), (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;iii&lt;/span&gt;) refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;iv&lt;/span&gt;) asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;) eligible to access the export controlled information without a &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;required&lt;/span&gt; export authorization, &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;) eligible &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; reasonably likely to obtain the &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;required&lt;/span&gt; export authorization &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; the applicable U.S. government agency. CoreWeave may, &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; legitimate business reasons, decline to pursue any export licensing process. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-function&quot;&gt;Job Requirements: Bachelor&#39;s/US &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; Foreign Equivalent &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Math, Software Engineering, &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; related field &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;eight&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;) years of experience &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; Software Engineering. Must have &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;seven&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;) years of experience &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; writing software unit tests, integration tests, &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; end-to-end tests. Must have &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;five&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;) years of experience &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; writing maintainable code &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; Python &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; Go&lt;/span&gt;; mentoring junior engineers; leading product engineering initiatives; writing technical specifications &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; distributed systems; proficiency &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; designing &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; implementing high performance APIs &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;using&lt;/span&gt; gRPC &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; Protocol Buffers; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; extensive experience &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; developing, deploying, &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; managing applications &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;on&lt;/span&gt; a Kubernetes platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;243&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;800&lt;/span&gt;-$&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;303&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;000&lt;/span&gt;/year&lt;/p&gt;
